                "text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:3em;\"><strong>Ashoka le Grand (env. 304-232 av. J.-C.) - Empereur indien de l'empire Maurya</strong></span></p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:1.5em;\">INFORMATIONS UND EXERCISES</span></strong></p>\n"
              },
